    "chunk_text": "re ned\u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he astah on medmycelne inno\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re a & \u00fea nolde he him gesceosan welige yldran, ac \u00fea \u00fee h\u00e6fdon lytle worldspeda, ne hie n\u00e6fdan for him & hw\u00e6\u00feere hie w\u00e6ron of Dauides cynnes strynde, \u00fe\u00e6s rihtcynecynnes. Nu we gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten forseah \u00feone welan \u00feisse worlde; & he eft \u00e6fter f\u00e6ce \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m unl\u00e6dum Hie hine swungon, & bundon, & sp\u00e6tledon on his onsyne, & mid bradre hand slogan, & mid heora Eal \u00feis he \u00ferowode for ure lufan & h\u00e6lo; \u00fey he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fe\u00e6t heofenlice rice onfengon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Hw\u00e6t wille we on domes d\u00e6g for\u00feberan \u00fe\u00e6s we for urum Drihtne arefnedon, nu he swa mycel for ure Monige men syndon \u00fee cwe\u00fea\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie on God gelyfon & hine lufian, & \u00feonne hwe\u00feere nella\u00fe Men \u00fea men \u00fee \u00feyssum uncystum fylga\u00f0, ne healda\u00fe hie Drihtnes bebodu ne his bysenum ne fylgea\u00f0; & se \u00fee him \u00feonne ne wile wi\u00festondan, he him \u00e6t his ende grim geweor\u00fee\u00fe & hine gel\u00e6de\u00fe on ece Gemunon we nu ure d\u00e6ghwamlican synna \u00fee we wi\u00f0 Godes willan geworht habba\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t we mid \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 seo so\u00fee hreow \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fea geworhtan synna andette & georne bete. Wepan we nu, & cwe\u00fean & ge\u00feencan hu Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ead",
